      "message": "\u003e Could you pass in the handler as argument instead ? Would it be fine to use the NsdService handler, or a new handler on the same looper ?\nNo, it needs a looper to create a new handler in NativeDaemonConnector and it would be used to handle the messagin inside (see l.130). We can pass the looper from NsdService but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s good because NativeDaemonConnector is running on another thread. If the handler is running on the same thread with NsdService, that may make a unsync problem. So I think using a new thread here shoulb be better.\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/frameworks/base/packages/Nsd/service/src/com/android/server/NsdService.java;l\u003d790",
